      "details": {
        "decision_status": "refused",
        "execution_status": "not_started",
        "stop_reason": "No exercise contrast: the three arms (Adult vehicle, Old vehicle, Old PDX) differ by age and drug only. Treadmill distance and voluntary wheel km/d in the metadata are per-animal fitness test readouts, not an assigned exercise exposure; regressing expression on them would be an associational fitness analysis the paper never planned. The paper's own contrasts (aging, PDX) do not answer how exercise affects gene expression."
